     "Generate on a new joiner: Open the employee form → Onboarding tab → click Generate from Template. Every line from the matching template is copied onto this employee.",
     "Tick tasks as done: Each task has an Is Done checkbox. Ticking it stamps done_by and done_date. Same model holds onboarding and offboarding rows, separated by the checklist_type field.",
     "Process resignation: WT HRMS → Resignations → New. Pick employee, reason, resignation date. Click Submit → approval chain runs → HR Manager Approve or Reject.",
