     "Onboarding Tab: Dedicated tab on hr.employee form scoped via domain to onboarding tasks only.",
     "Offboarding Tab: Sister tab for leavers: same UX, separate domain. The lifecycle Recovery checklist HR has been writing on whiteboards.",
