     "Import filters by payment and fulfilment status; POS orders; shipped history imported with its deliveries done.",
     "Order edits made in Shopify applied in Odoo; delivered or invoiced lines refused with a note.",
     "Fulfilments against the fulfillment order from the warehouse Shopify assigned, with tracking, partial shipments, split deliveries per location, and fulfilments made in Shopify validating the Odoo delivery.",
